--   957 Inspiring the Outstanding Scholarship (KU Leuven)
--   958 Doctoral Scholarships for Candidates from the Global South (Ghent University, BOF)
--   959 Science@Leuven Scholarship (KU Leuven Faculty of Science)
--   960 EPL Excellence Scholarships (UCLouvain)
-- Sources 3093 (EPL), 3094 (Inspiring), 3095 (Science@Leuven), 3096 (DOS);
-- links 960->3093, 957->3094, 959->3095, 958->3096; us 688-691.
-- NOTE ON IDS: the four scholarship INSERTs were executed in parallel with
-- RETURNING and completed Inspiring (957) -> DOS (958) -> Science@Leuven
-- (959) -> EPL (960); the mapping below is pinned from those RETURNING results.
